[
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "It wasn't their military spending, their scientific experiments or their inherently unlikable natures that cost the Mantizi their empirical might. No, it was something else entirely that contributed to the downfall of their once great civilization. Expansionism brought them to the death-knell, as it were."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "軍事的支出、科学実験、あるいは本質的に好ましくない性質が、マンティツィ族に経験的な力を犠牲にしたわけではありません。 いいえ、それは彼らのかつての偉大な文明の崩壊に貢献した他のすべてでした。 拡張主義は彼らを死の地獄へと導いた。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "Having spread too rapidly and too far among the neighboring systems stressed their economy until it reached an inevitable breaking point. The Mantizi, never great with money in the first place (they are far too hard-coded to use current resources for short-term gain, due in part to their natural evolution as a species), were not even aware of a problem until it was too late."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "近隣のシステムの間であまりにも急速に広がったとあまりにも遠くは、それが避けられない限界に達するまで、彼らの経済を強調しました。 マンティジ族は、そもそも金で大したことはない(種としての自然な進化のために、現在の資源を短期的に利益のために使うにはあまりにもハードコードされている)が、手遅れになるまで問題に気付かなかった。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "Within twenty years, the coffers of the empire were empty. Workers could no longer be paid, and the unemployment rate rapidly reached over 87% (estimated 87.72% at the official time of dissolution). What followed was a massive civil war, and the complete slaughter of every single member of the senate. Even the Oracles were slain, their entrails used as sashes."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "二十年もしないうちに、帝国の金庫は空になった。労働者に賃金を払えなくなり、失業率は急速に87%を超えた（正式な解体時点の推定値は87.72%）。その後、大規模な内戦が起き、元老院議員は一人残らず虐殺された。神託者たちさえ殺され、そのはらわたは帯にされた。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/3",
      "value": "The citizens attempted to replace the government, but too much damage had already been done. The empire, as it was, ceased to exist. The estimated death tally across their entire territory is 4,245,167,211."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/3",
      "value": "国民は政府を置き換えようと試みたが、すでに多くの被害が発生した。 帝国は、それにもかかわらず、存在しなくなった。 地域全体の死亡推定数は 4,245,167,211 です。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/4",
      "value": "What remains now are numerous tribes. They cling to individual worlds, though their tendency to live lives of excess has not diminished in the least. At last count, the remaining Mantizi worlds still house over 65 billion individuals. Of that population, 32% are Artisans or Artists, 7% are philosophers, 8% work in brothels or similar professions. Clearly Mantizi enjoy expression."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/4",
      "value": "現在残されているのは、多くの民族である。 彼らは個々の世界にしがみついていますが、過剰な生活を送る傾向は少なくとも減少していません。 ついに 残りのマンチジ語の世界は 65 何十億人もの人です その中でも 32% は職人や芸術家、 7% は哲学者、 8% は売春宿や類似の職業です。 明らかにマンチジは表現を楽しむ。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/5",
      "value": "We cannot neglect to mention their natural combat abilities. Despite the empire no longer being a power, the old ways remain popular and are well practiced among the majority of their people due to the Vorgeth Cygna Doctrine still being held as a 'core' Virtue (a fancy way of Mantizi saying 'mandatory learning for the good of all')."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/5",
      "value": "彼らの自然な戦闘能力は言うまでもない。 帝国はもはや権力を欠いているにもかかわらず、古いやり方は依然として人気があり、ヴォージュス・シグナ・ドクトリンが「中核」の徳としてまだ保持されているため、彼らの国民の大半の間でよく実践されている(マンティジの派手なやり方は「すべての利益のために必須の学習」と呼んでいる)。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/6",
      "value": "Only time will tell if they can once again forge a lasting empire and unite the tribes. They would be welcome voices in the Protectorate, should they once again create a viable government."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/6",
      "value": "彼らが再び永続的な帝国を形成し、部族を団結できるかどうかは、時間だけがわかります。 彼らは保護領で歓迎の声になるでしょう、もし再び実行可能な政府を作り出せば。"
    }
  ],
